  "description": "The ULTRA-GRIT SPORTFIT is derived from the race-proven ULTRA-GRIT platform, developed with the Ribble Outliers gravel team in the world’s toughest off-road races, from Unbound to The Traka and The Dirty Reiver. With its more upright, confident riding position, SPORTFIT gives you greater control without compromising speed. Weighing just 8.9 kg, it pairs our lightweight, aero-optimised frameset with a rugged SRAM Apex XPLR AXS wireless drivetrain, durable DT Swiss G 1800 wheels, 45mm Schwalbe G-One R tyres, and a comfort-focused Selle Italia Novus Boost Evo saddle. Topped off with an ergonomic one-piece carbon cockpit.",
